    Knowledge: the fifth judgement round's defects
    
    A folder of .git that cannot be listed refuses the repository; knowledge/ and
    knowledge/projects/ must be folders themselves; HEAD is followed only to a name
    under refs/. The socket a person's own git leaves in .git is let through.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>

